              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi nai tolimunoe ŋikilyok ŋiarei: Yosepu ŋolo anyaritae Barisaba (ŋolo arae ekiro keŋ ece Yusito) ka Matia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodo kilipa temasi, “Ekapolon, iyeni iyoŋ etau a ŋinituŋanan, kitoodikinae tokona isua alokilyok a ŋuluarei a lu ŋolo iseu iyoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itemokino iŋes kitiya etic ŋolo ke Ekiyakia, kilunyokin lotic ŋolo aesikini Yuda ŋolo abu tolot neni etemokino iŋes toyai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilamilama ikes ŋamoru ŋuna egiritae ŋirorwa, kilo ekiro a Matia; toseunae nai iŋes kimorikinae Lokiyakia ŋulutomon ka epei.",
          "type": "text",
